Z||000000||william_thorniii||11-22-2000||04:37 PM||||A young man says "The day before Thanksgiving is the biggest bar night of the year."<P>An old man says "The day before Thanksgiving is the biggest traveling day of the year."<P>A woman says "The day after Thanksgiving is the biggest shopping day of the year."<P>I say... if all of this is true, what happens in Canada? <P>--Can you all understand what this post means?  That's right... another boring afternoon in the office the day before a holiday.  <P>William T. Thorn, III ||||reg||6
